    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Maison de la Mer, the Emerald coast’s most captivating getaway. Located in Seagrove and less than 0.5 of a mile to the center of Seaside, this gulf front retreat is just what you need to make <br>memories of a lifetime. Walk to the town of Seaside or enjoy fine dining accommodations at the Surfing Deer restaurant across the street. Bask in the sun or the shade on the oversized deck with stunning panoramic views of the gulf!!! This 7 bedroom, 8.5 bathroom estate features a media room and enough space for your large group to spread out comfortably. Each and every bedroom has its own en-suite bathroom!! There is a junior master bedroom suite on the main level! This is the most luxurious home, in the most idyllic location!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
